      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n\nOpenAI, Apify and Google Sheets credentials are wired to your existing accounts. Results go to the \"Upwork Jobs\" Google Sheet.\n\nActor: hyperbach/upwork-scraper-ai (notifications_only: each run returns only jobs new since the last run, billed once). Runs every 2 hours, up to 20 jobs per run, payment-verified clients only, human-role jobs excluded; Skip Already Seen Jobs drops any job an earlier run already handled. If a proposal fails, the job is still logged with Status \"Proposal failed\".",
